# 🏛️ TOGAF Governance & Risk Metrics — CodeMind Playbook

> **Purpose:** Instruct the CodeMind AI agent to analyze one or two repositories and produce
> a production-grade TOGAF Governance & Risk Metrics Report — covering current-state
> architecture assessment, governance structure health, compliance monitoring, risk
