    Gradle: check task, PMD plugin, Checkstyle plugin, SpotBugs plugin,
            JaCoCo coverage enforcement, compilejava task
    Maven:  checkstyle:check, pmd:check, spotbugs:check, jacoco:check
    Node:   eslint / tslint in package.json scripts
    Python: flake8 / pylint / mypy in pipeline or tox.ini
    → Status: ENFORCED if quality plugin present AND fails build on violation
              IMPLIED if plugin present but no fail-on-error config found
              NOT DETECTED if no quality plugin found

  API Contract Enforcement:
    openapi.yaml / swagger.json present → ENFORCED (spec exists)
    @Operation / @ApiResponse annotations only → IMPLIED (annotation-only docs)
    No OpenAPI spec, no annotations → NOT DETECTED

  Naming Conventions:
    .editorconfig present → IMPLIED (editor-level enforcement)
    checkstyle.xml with naming rules → ENFORCED
    Consistent package structure (e.g., com.company.domain.service.*) → IMPLIED
    No config → NOT DETECTED (but can note observed convention from source)

  Dependency Version Management:
    gradle/libs.versions.toml → ENFORCED (centralized catalog)
    <dependencyManagement> BOM → ENFORCED
    Lock file (package-lock.json, poetry.lock, gradle.lockfile) → ENFORCED
    No centralized version control → NOT DETECTED

  Security Standards:
    TLS / mTLS config in application.yml or K8s → ENFORCED
    @PreAuthorize / Spring Security filter chain → ENFORCED
    CORS config (@CrossOrigin or WebSecurityConfigurerAdapter) → ENFORCED/IMPLIED
    Input validation (@Valid, @Validated, custom validators) → ENFORCED

  Data Privacy Controls:
    @JsonIgnore on sensitive fields → IMPLIED
    PII masking in logging config → ENFORCED if present
    Data classification annotations or comments → IMPLIED

  Audit Logging:
    Audit trail class / @Audited annotation → ENFORCED
    Request/response logging interceptor → IMPLIED
    No audit mechanism → NOT DETECTED

  Regulatory Compliance (domain-specific):
    Scan for regulatory keywords in: class names, validator names,
    error code constants, comments, README
    Examples: 12CFR1, SMMP, QIB, GDPR, PCI, SOX, HIPAA, MiFID
    → List each found with evidence file and class/constant name
