    Resilience4j    → @Retry, RetryRegistry
    Manual retry    → for loop with sleep/wait in service layer
    → Capture: class name, what is retried, max attempts config key/value

  Circuit Breaker:
    Resilience4j    → @CircuitBreaker annotation
    Hystrix         → @HystrixCommand (legacy)
    → Capture: class name, what is protected, fallback method name

  Fallback / Degraded Mode:
    Stale data retention on refresh failure
    Default value returned on cache miss
    Feature flag disabling behavior on downstream failure
    → Capture: class:method implementing fallback, what data is retained

  Timeout Configuration:
    RestTemplate / WebClient → connection/read timeout config
    HTTP client config in application.yml (timeout keys)
    → Capture: config keys and values (not secret values)

  Bulkhead / Rate Limiting:
    @Bulkhead (Resilience4j) / ThreadPoolBulkhead
    Rate limit filter in Spring Security or gateway config
    → Capture: class:annotation or config

  Dead Letter / Error Queue:
    Kafka DLQ topic config or @KafkaListener errorHandler
    RabbitMQ dead-letter-exchange config
    → Capture: DLQ topic/queue name if found
```

