    (✅ count + 0.5 × ⚠️ count) / 15 × 100  [from Part 3]

  compliance_controls_score:
    (✅ count + 0.5 × ⚠️ count) / 14 × 100  [from Part 4]

  togaf_maturity_average:
    (Business + Data + Application + Technology) / 4  [from Part 7]

  overall_governance_score:
    Weighted average:
      governance_structures × 0.25
    + compliance_controls   × 0.25
    + togaf_maturity / 5    × 0.30  (normalized to 0–100)
    + (1 - critical_gaps/total_gaps) × 0.20

  GRADING:
    90–100 = A  (Governance-mature, production-ready)
    75–89  = B  (Good governance, minor gaps)
    60–74  = C  (Adequate, notable governance gaps)
    40–59  = D  (Significant governance debt)
    0–39   = F  (Critical governance deficiencies)
```

